; Storage in a MariaCEL board's SDRAM, for an `atari/mariacel.ngp` program: the
; Banks of the unit set `sdram`, read through the Window `cel8000`, and the
; decoders the tool ships. A Project includes this beside the machine. The
; driver is the machine's, since it brings the board up and shows a Pane's Bank
; whether or not there is storage.
storage { units sdram }

; Every Transition calls the decoders, so they are resident; a decoder nothing
; uses is dropped.
modules { "stream/zx0.asm" }
resident { zx0 }
